% What the meal-assistance policy should say about its four people
% (lesson 0).  A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/eligibility.dl --expect programs/eligibility.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/eligibility.dl --expect programs/eligibility.expect

eligible(bob).                       % cyril's pension qualifies oak_house
eligible(cyril).
qualifying_household(elm_house).     % edith cares for a pensioner
eligible(edith).
:- eligible(dana).                   % employed
